6754173", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823790_1744578970087506_184867581268551437_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cKx47bQ-190Q7kNvwGK8T7X&_nc_oc=Adomq85fi73kYpNhQ-DJo1bk0dVXBlaRXOh9o6Co4xBwYHdHsm3IrBHPHhKVwPJtuco&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNCrUzEVn9bfoMfQt8Q8A2R89wsu7ur7FZ11msgwI1uOw&oe=6AC7B9E0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt3Upscaled.png", "id": "1564248915736562", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_1564248922403228_6762068753518313366_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bFSZW7J5y_QQ7kNvwFvhdFT&_nc_oc=AdokF3ervFYgXgNHdBv-CujC0-UrpehnAChDNHxxDz2pyLRnlqpjPaFVgXX1xYdQ3Iw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMEC8Jktssk2US3LlTd3c-gBCk2v_FqHE-ltX7U0rzyPA&oe=6AC79FE1"}, "display_name": "Cookie Puncher", "keywords": ["Cookie", "Punching", "Workout", "Bakery", "Boxing"], "long_description": "Welcome to Cookie Puncher - the only place where smashing cookies is not just allowed\u2026 it\u2019s encouraged.\n\nStep into a  world where your fists are the ultimate baking tool. Punch, crush, fling, and obliterate cookies in wildly satisfying ways. Whether you're going for precision hits or full - on cookie carnage, every swing counts.\n\nBut don't get too comfortable - the Cookie Thief is always looking for a chance to ruin your fun. Stay sharp, keep punching, and prove who's really in charge of the kitchen!\n\n\ud83e\udd4a Features:\n\ud83c\udf6aPunch Cookies - Smash your way through cookies with your own fists.\n\ud83d\udca5Crunchy Feedback - Feel every hit as you pound cookies into pieces.\n\ud83d\uded2Shop & Customize - Unlock new items and customize your experience.\n\ud83e\uddb9\u200d\u2642\ufe0fChallenge the Cookie Thief - Keep an eye out for the thief and take on the challenge.\n\nPunch first. Ask questions later.\n\nThis is stress relief\u2026 but tastier.", "